{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4e393a97fb7f9c26a7da5bdb67c3bd0422fb448d6962603a8f66d78fd38e60bf", "ja": "またいつの日か", "zh": "来日再见", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2c53597315ebebdf3a2a80fd8f4211f1e24c407851c6dba5df1af4fb3fb79967", "ja": "再放送と新作ドラマは、無事好評に終わる。\n可奈、未来、琴葉が劇場に届いた感想を読ん\nでいると、そこに詩花がやってくる。本物は\nあんなに容易くないですよとイタズラっぽく\n笑う詩花に、3人は望むところだと応える。", "zh": "重播和新作电视剧都顺利地获得了好评。\n可奈、未来和琴叶正在阅读送到剧场的感想时，\n诗花来到了她们身边。面对笑得像是在恶作剧般说\n“真正的可没那么容易哦”的诗花，3人回答说：“正合我意。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1152638f64a3ddf0036a795f2b4c4b6ce396efee6ba5ecb0077242cb543b9f8", "ja": "（『階のスターエレメンツ』、再放送も\n新作のスペシャル版ドラマも非常に好評だった）", "zh": "（《阶梯的明星元素》的重播和新作特别版电视剧都大获好评。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bd9ef7c2218fd3108193e9a08d191a3fdeb72c8441ea91af02297d7d03cc68b9", "ja": "（ファンの人達から、熱量の高い感想が続々と\n届いている。早速、みんなにも読んでもらおう！）", "zh": "（粉丝们热情洋溢的感想接连不断地传来。赶紧也让大家读读吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "1f10fbfd5b6ca6dde5bcb2086819d08ef50bbbaa3b196bc5dc88e7e5b37f44f0", "ja": "わあ……！　感想たっぷり～♪\nこれには水桜も、にっこり～♪　えへ♪", "zh": "哇……！满满都是感想～♪\n看到这些，水樱也笑眯眯的～♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "fa0b0e77bb77cce0a29ebed68e98308a6a71f47ea9170874b53c3c6b17ec2e0f", "ja": "『こんなんじゃ全然足りないよ～！\nスタエレの3人がもっと見たい！』だって！", "zh": "“说是『这根本不够看嘛～！\n好想看到更多星光群英的3个人！』呢！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "082b843da4a632c69e7fa26316302b6cf4c6defb38b5d92508c34cf826805eda", "ja": "自分が演じた役を好きになって\nもらえるのは、光栄だよね。", "zh": "能让别人喜欢上自己演过的角色，真是件光荣的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "e3d096bb730f79bf0f634a061284eff0a699071639ea3865c31b89ac0ce4bbde", "ja": "『星蘭さんの過去が気になります。\n続編希望！』だそうです。よかった……。", "zh": "“有人说：‘很在意星兰小姐的过去。希望能推出续篇！’太好了……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "51163a91135d85145955995d1b531e30b8cef966c28675c8fb1c8020d296b7ce", "ja": "そうだな。……続けていれば、\nまた機会は巡ってくると思うから。", "zh": "是啊……只要继续下去，我想机会还会再次到来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1007_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7cc962973d38db928a609f7e4bed94302e7d9270ac68bb515c10d8d82781f234", "ja": "？　青羽さんかな？\nはい、どうぞ。", "zh": "？是青羽小姐吗？请进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1009_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5014cc777f1276cc53a57d5853a56d650b62587ab7059de573106911b369fcb0", "ja": "みなさん、グリュース・ゴット！\n近くに来たので、また寄ってしまいました。", "zh": "各位，Grüß Gott！\n因为刚好来到附近，所以又顺道过来拜访了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "f879b698d46256242a71c14c6d6aeb79433e3887cdbb36225e1293422a5996c5", "ja": "あっ、詩花さん！　こんにちは！", "zh": "啊，诗花小姐！你好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "b2eb16a3ce3aa6ee895543879211c607039e3823ccace0fd69c5e309f5c8e76e", "ja": "ちょうど話してたんですよ～！\nこの前の、ドラマのこと！", "zh": "我们刚好还在聊呢～！\n就是之前那部电视剧的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1012_201xxx", "source_sha256": "39dea658e72789882191be4d2bffb4b38135b1c2a32aa37db223770426b31cea", "ja": "本当ですか？　私も、765プロのみなさんと\nお芝居できて、とっても楽しかったです♪", "zh": "真的吗？我也能和765事务所的大家一起演戏，特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6d228f59b7d8dfcd7f10a23cfc406c76e94c068a6364ffe8d039f108bdf0760f", "ja": "思ったより過激な役だったから、\nうまくできたか心配でしたけど……。", "zh": "因为角色比我想象中要过激得多，\n之前我还挺担心演得好不好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "a7acd48db5442abfd4a72bd2c3998f25f91cd2872d3af9527c723ab1e6da4a84", "ja": "詩花ちゃんの御剣摩耶、すごくよかったと思う。\n私たちも、いい経験になったし……。", "zh": "诗花饰演的御剑摩耶，我觉得真的很棒。对我们来说，也是一次很好的经历……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "20f67317f5ba3ccbe4ed01d408fa9bb1514b10bbf11b09de67927a1a21600c11", "ja": "本当にありがとう。", "zh": "真的非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1016_201xxx", "source_sha256": "cec2522a66ce5f1aa49b175d2b78cd108c0f13dc08f4ec272a961e268e6bfbb0", "ja": "そんな、こちらこそです。\nでも……。", "zh": "哪里，应该是我谢谢您才对。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1017_201xxx", "source_sha256": "808a68d994184c37d2cb5cc6bc8fdbbd49aaff2efd16e80e6a1b0aa70d131893", "ja": "本当のアイドルのステージでは、\n私はあんなに容易くありませんよ？　……なんて♪", "zh": "在真正的偶像舞台上，我可没那么容易对付哦？……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c1b3c2120b6d75d4b7ab1db741a284cafe031a7ba8771ae159368954450a49c", "ja": "ふふ……当然だよね。\nもちろん、望むところだよ！", "zh": "呵呵……那当然啦。\n当然求之不得！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "27819ed60efc1f595d7ce161c263ef661e768ed0ba08edbcbc9ccdf663de7919", "ja": "私も！　ステージで詩花さんと\n戦うことがあったら、絶対負けませんよ～！", "zh": "我也是！要是在舞台上和诗花交手，我绝对不会输的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "a9e7d57e44368a3ff22bee0f2ba2782aac4fa137480e64761072038db5daba7b", "ja": "わ、私だって！\n必死で食らいついてみせますから！", "zh": "我、我也是！\n我会拼尽全力迎头赶上的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0da7d5407dc5b2c3fa458db7c492cd3370f1dc4af6e56d8e7acfe8121303bea8", "ja": "（インパクトのあるドラマに、強力なライバル……\n物語は、現実でもいい刺激になったみたいだ）", "zh": "（有冲击力的电视剧，还有强大的对手……\n看来这个故事也给现实带来了很好的刺激。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0359_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b908501ad83e664a1487f5b55d387c3461ff84b979cd7edb9372e2ddbd9c1352", "ja": "（改めて、目指せトップアイドル……だな！\n俺も一層、気を引き締めないと！）", "zh": "（再次向着顶尖偶像努力……对吧！我也得更加打起精神来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
